{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15782","headline":"送张链师还峨嵋山 · 司空曙","name":"送张链师还峨嵋山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"太一天坛天柱西，垂萝爲幌石爲梯。\n前登灵境青霄绝，下视人间白日低。\n松籁万声和管磐，丹光五色杂虹蜺。\n春山一入寻无路，鸟响烟深水满溪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"司空曙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15782.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15782","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}